  m_text: "<color=#FFB534>GOAL</color>  Fill the coin quota to relight the <color=#43D9BD>portal</color>,
    then jump in. Clear all three worlds to bring the gold home.\n<color=#FFD54A>Coin</color>
    1 pt  \xB7  <color=#6EC8FF>Gem</color> 5 pts  \xB7  quick pickups build a COMBO
    (up to x4)  \xB7  <color=#FF6F61>Heart</color> heals  \xB7  <color=#6EC8FF>Speed</color> 
